OL,4,CAttempted murder arrest after          
OL,5,Ccouncillor stabbed                     
OL,6,GA councillor has been seriously        
OL,7,Ginjured after being stabbed while      
OL,8,Gundertaking his duties in Bradford.    
OL,10,FBradford Moor councillor Ibrar Ali was 
OL,11,Fattacked at about 11:04 GMT on Manse   
OL,12,FStreet, according to the deputy leader 
OL,13,Fof Your Bradford Independent Group,    
OL,14,Fcouncillor Ishtiaq Ahmed.              
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police said a 32-year-  
OL,17,Fold man had been arrested on suspicion 
OL,18,Fof attempted murder and was being held 
OL,19,Fin custody.                            
